==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|þýða|lang=non}}, from {{proto|Germanic|þiudijanan|lang=is}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈθiːða/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|iːða|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|þýddi|þýtt}}

# {{transitive|takes the accusative|lang=is}} to [[translate]] a language
#: ''Gætirðu '''þýtt''' þetta fyrir mig?''
#:: Could you '''translate''' this for me?

